            "text": "For most people with a blender, a regular whey such as Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard mixed with milk, oats and peanut butter. For maximum calories with no cooking, a mass gainer such as Optimum Nutrition Serious Mass or Dymatize Super Mass Gainer. For a leaner approach, Optimum Nutrition Pro Gainer offers more protein and fewer carbohydrate calories."
